ante on Violet, who makes an unexpected discovery during the club's re-opening.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gN7ucj5ewA9JBJlS1DFLE6F831Y.jpg","released":"2025-03-15T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"58 min"},{"id":"tt27191732:1:5","season":1,"episode":5,"title":"Monster","overview":"When key information behind Silvio’s murder falls into the wrong hands, it sets off a dangerous chain of events for Kate and Violet. Evie tries to reconcile with her grief.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rl7iJwHBN0OmsWvDwFIU1NUqgy2.jpg","released":"2025-03-22T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"57 min"},{"id":"tt27191732:1:6","season":1,"episode":6,"title":"Rage","overview":"As the club prepares for a defining night, Kate finds unexpected allies in her pursuit of power. Violet seeks revenge for Lily, while Billie weighs up her future.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vFw9M0Xwj4CkXHk7vHTa5Keoytk.jpg","released":"2025-03-29T12:00:00.000Z","runtime":"56 min"}]}}